<title>FRANCE: Block of Lyonnaise stock trades.</title>
<headline>Block of Lyonnaise stock trades.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 239,000 Suez/Lyonnaise des Eaux shares traded at 585 francs per share, just after the market opened, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock was down 0.17 percent at 584 francs at 0825 GMT.</p>
</text>
